# Docker ignore file
# Exclude unnecessary files from Docker build context

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/*.dll
**/*.pdb
**/*.exe

# IDE files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Test files
**/test/
**/tests/
**/*Test*.cs
**/*Tests*.cs

# Documentation (keep only essential)
**/*.md
!README.md
!Dockerfile
!docker-compose.yml

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Node modules (if any)
**/node_modules/

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
**/*.cache

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Large assets (if not needed)
**/wwwroot/BSO/Assets/
**/wwwroot/JamlGenie/

# Keep only essential wwwroot files
**/wwwroot/*
!**/wwwroot/favicon.ico
!**/wwwroot/robots.txt

